<http://purl.org/spar/datacite/gnd> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "A Gemeinsame Normdatei identifier is resolvable from the following URL: https://d-nb.info/gnd/<identifier>."@en .
# 
# http://purl.org/spar/datacite/google-scholar
<http://purl.org/spar/datacite/google-scholar> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
